; TelegramSMC_TradeLogger - default preset
; In MT5: Strategy Tester > Expert Advisor: TelegramSMC_TradeLogger > Inputs tab > Load
; or on the chart's EA Inputs dialog > Load.
;
; InpSymbol and InpMagicNumber must match the EA that is actually placing the
; trades (TelegramSMC_Copier.mq5 ships InpMagicNumber=20260918 on XAUUSD by
; default) - this EA only logs, it never places or closes anything itself.
;
; InpSourceLabel is just a free-text tag written to every logged row's
; "source" column - it does not affect what gets watched. This EA is generic
; (see the file header), so to instead journal the Claude-SMC Trader's
; trades, point InpSymbol/InpMagicNumber at that solution's own values
; (XAUUSD / 20260921 - see ../../ClaudeSMC_Trader/python/config.py) and set
; InpSourceLabel=Claude_Sig.
;
InpSymbol=XAUUSD
InpMagicNumber=20260918
InpSourceLabel=Telegram_Sig
InpUseCommonFolder=false
InpMagicNumber2=0
InpSourceLabel2=Claude_Sig
